Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.30,0:00:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Este lugar está infestado deles.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.01,0:00:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Não podemos derrubar todos, não é?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.14,0:00:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece que precisaremos rever nosso plano.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.01,0:00:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Esmagá-las... {\alpha&HFF&}Esmagá-las... Esmagá-las... Esmagá-las...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.89,0:00:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Esmagá-las... Esmagá-las... {\alpha&HFF&}Esmagá-las... Esmagá-las...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.47,0:00:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Esmagá-las... Esmagá-las... Esmagá-las... {\alpha&HFF&}Esmagá-las...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.27,0:00:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Esmagá-las... Esmagá-las... Esmagá-las... Esmagá-las...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.10,0:00:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Esmagar até a última bruxa!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.02,0:00:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou assassinar todas elas!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.77,0:00:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Felicia-san?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.23,0:00:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,O que está fazendo?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.73,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Akira!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.69,0:00:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Não posso deixar ela ir sozinha!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.90,0:00:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, esperem!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.04,0:01:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, Felicia-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.22,0:01:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou te massacrar!
