Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.52,0:09:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sou Mitsuki Felicia.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.02,0:09:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Qual é o seu nome?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.65,0:09:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Iroha. {\alpha&HFF&}Tamaki Iroha.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.03,0:09:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Iroha. Tamaki Iroha.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.53,0:09:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Beleza, Iroha!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.24,0:09:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Se alguém comprar briga contigo aqui em Kamihama, me chame.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.24,0:09:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou te ajudar com um descontinho de amigos e familiares.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.70,0:09:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai me cobrar do mesmo jeito?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.91,0:09:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Como eu disse, sou uma mercenária que recebe por sua atuação.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.83,0:09:27.96,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an5\org(1005.3,234.9)\pos(998.667,235.333)\blur5\fnVillain Team-Up\c&H5055D2&\fry-3.59\frx8.27\frz-18.91\fscx35\fscy40\alpha&HA0&}Vencedor
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.83,0:09:27.96,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an5\org(1005.3,234.9)\pos(998.667,235.333)\blur0.5\fnVillain Team-Up\c&H5055D2&\fry-3.59\frx8.27\frz-18.91\fscx35\fscy40}Vencedor
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.54,0:09:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,O meu palito é um vencedor! Que sorte!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.67,0:09:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,O seu também, Iroha!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.71,0:09:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Velhote, mais dois do mesmo!
