Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.38,0:12:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Vencemos, Felicia-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.97,0:12:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,É a primeira vez que ganho num negócio destes!
